name: Reviewed exact scopes and local context survive six installed-scanner jobs
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/installed_scope_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 Build project context: | prepared-context
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Owned common source context
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | imported-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 Enter / c build inventory | empty-scopes
keys: c
require-live-snap: 30 DRAFT SCOPES | whole-repository
ask: Is whole-repository inspection available before any explicit split, with inventory limits and no model or scan work?
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 First scope name | split-form
type: Service
keys: Tab
type: service
keys: Tab
type: Root files
keys: Tab
type: loose.py
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 30 r2 | split-result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/installed_scope_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART split
expect: Root files
ask: Does the split preserve the loose root file in an explicit residual boundary, with exact nonoverlapping membership and no automatic scan?
keys: f
require-live-snap: 20 Files 1..1 of 1 | service-members
expect: service/notice.py
keys: Escape Down f
require-live-snap: 20 loose.py | root-members
expect: loose.py
keys: Escape Up a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | accept-boundaries
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-scopes
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/installed_scope_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
keys: Space Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 2 boundaries marked | selected-scopes
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | scope-study
expect: 6 fixed discovery jobs
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engine-choice
expect: [x] semgrep
keys: a Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE CONTEXT | associations
expect: inherits common
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | service-picker
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | common-inspection
keys: e Enter C-u
paste-file: @ART/local-context.txt
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW CONTEXT CHANGES | context-diff
expect: Service scope:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Edited copy saved | inactive-copy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Service scope: | copy-inspection
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for | service-override
expect: exact override
expect: inherits common
ask: Can the operator edit an inactive context copy, inspect its diff and associate it with one boundary while the sibling inherits common context?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 SCOPE CONTEXT | context-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 SCOPE CONTEXT | context-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 SCOPE CONTEXT | context-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 SCOPE CONTEXT | context-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 SCOPE CONTEXT | context-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-page-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | protected-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Scope draft ready | frozen-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/installed_scope_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
expect: 6 fixed jobs
expect: 60000 ms per job
expect: Execution model: none
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-spending
expect: Protected review calls: 1
ask: Does approval show both three-pass scopes, their exact context revisions and a finite time/call allowance without approving later subdivisions?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Approval saved | approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/installed_scope_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 6 completed | completed
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-service.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned policy marker needs an owner decision | service-finding
expect: service/notice.py
submit: decision deferred Service owner policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-root.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned policy marker needs an owner decision | root-finding
expect: loose.py
submit: decision deferred Root file owner policy review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | scope-report
expect: 0 committed / 1 calls
expect: 1 protected review remaining
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: report-page-40x12
ask: Are per-scope recurrence and context provenance reachable while policy signals remain separate from confirmed vulnerabilities and fixed status?
resize: 120x36
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/installed_scope_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | restored-study
nav-mode:
keys: a Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SCOPE CONTEXT | restored-contexts
expect: Service · exact override
expect: Root files · inherits common
keys: Escape Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | restored-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/installed_scope_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain accepted membership, the local override, inherited common context, six observations and two decisions without another job or model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
